OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear and
OL,6,Fbright evening for many. Cloud
OL,7,Fthickens and lowers over the hills in
OL,8,Fthe east overnight, with isolated
OL,9,Fshowers moving into the south through
OL,10,Fthe early hours. Mild night to come.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIsolated light showers
OL,13,Fcontinue to feed up from the south,
OL,14,Fbut some places staying dry and seeing
OL,15,Fsome bright spells into the afternoon,
OL,16,Fparticularly further north. Staying
OL,17,Fwarm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
