OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FChangeable weather with spells of
OL,7,Fheavy rain, some thunderstorms and
OL,8,Fstrong winds. Brighter intervals and
OL,9,Fscattered showers at times.
OL,10,FTemperatures mostly near normal,
OL,11,Ffeeling warm and humid initially.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
